                            </td>
                            <td class="matrix-cell"><span class="matrix-pill pill-check"><svg class="matrix-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Estándar</span></td>
                            <td class="matrix-cell highlight-col"><span class="matrix-pill pill-check"><svg class="matrix-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Alta resolución HD</span></td>
                            <td class="matrix-cell"><span class="matrix-pill pill-check"><svg class="matrix-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg> Con logo incorporado</span></td>
